    },
    {
      "text": "Dust veal shanks lightly with flour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-mzVtlwAcn1VPC8cHyoGz8CFd_E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87389-traditional-osso-buco-ddmfs-step2-4x3-0026-188fda1cd2954b34a4265624cc6c7cde.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87389/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large skillet over medium to medium-high heat. Add veal; cook until browned on outsides. Transfer to a bowl; keep warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9UsjUQfMyi_WCwnlBuabyU8jehM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87389-traditional-osso-buco-ddmfs-step3-4x3-0028-85eae77ec69c4802afcbd1264a72d39d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87389/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add onion and 2 cloves crushed garlic to the skillet; cook and stir until onion is tender.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AX77aoqzJTv9Pn3e4jSodIERfYQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87389-traditional-osso-buco-ddmfs-step4-4x3-0033-871adfb8f72a405d9ca848678712e7c7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87389/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return veal to the skillet; stir in carrot and wine. Simmer for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8QEXbGhUDADCgWjLVrWI65poiaQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87389-traditional-osso-buco-ddmfs-step5-4x3-0035-9f94d213b6bb41a7be56d6cbb1ffb5cb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87389/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add tomatoes and beef stock; season with salt and black pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/skjDZtS_iM_WsFstVhbDhkJ_3B4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87389-traditional-osso-buco-ddmfs-step6-4x3-0036-0e039e9f4e1442d8a86bc9822877a177.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87389/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover; simmer over low heat for 1 ½ hours, basting veal every 15 minutes or so. The meat should be tender, but not falling off the bone.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IhR29au7MOROmbBYWsZCHjJDR8Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87389-traditional-osso-buco-ddmfs-step7-4x3-0076-83458b5e6590465fb5151782fc23bc00.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87389/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine parsley, lemon zest, and 1 clove minced garlic in a small bowl. Sprinkle gremolata over veal just before serving.",
